            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "二、填空题:6~10 小题, 每小题 4 分, 共 20 分. 请将答案写在答题纸上."
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.096,
                0.132,
                0.569,
                0.166
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "6. 设函数 \\( f(x,y)=\\int_{0}^{xy}\\frac{\\sin t}{1+t^{2}}dt \\) ，则 \\( f_{xx}(0,2)= \\) ____.",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.096,
                0.178,
                0.677,
                0.209
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "7. 空间曲线 \\(\\left\\{ \\begin{array}{l} x^{2} + y^{2} + z^{2} = 6, \\\\ x + y + z = 0, \\end{array} \\right.\\) 在点 \\((1, -2, 1)\\) 处的法平面方程为 ____.",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.096,
                0.227,
                0.666,
                0.269
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "8. 设 \\(\\Omega: x^2 + y^2 + z^2 \\leq 1\\)，则 \\(\\iiint_{\\Omega} \\frac{z^3 \\ln (x^2 + y^2 + z^2 + 1)}{(x^2 + y^2 + z^2 + 1)^6} dv = \\) ____.",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.097,
                0.281,
                0.554,
                0.32
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "9. 设 \\(L\\) 是圆周 \\(x^{2} + y^{2} = R^{2}\\)，则 \\(\\oint_{L} (x^{2} + y) ds = \\) ____.",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.097,
                0.327,
                0.888,
                0.363
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "10. 设 \\( f(x) = \\begin{cases} x^2 + 1, & 0 < x \\leq \\pi, \\\\ x^2 - 1, & -\\pi < x \\leq 0, \\end{cases} \\) 则 \\( f(x) \\) 以 \\( 2\\pi \\) 为周期的傅里叶级数在点 \\( x = \\pi \\) 处收敛于 ____.",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph_title",
            "bbox": [
                0.079,
                0.378,
                0.918,
                0.42
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "三、解答题:11～16 小题，每小题 10 分，共 60 分.请将解答写在答题纸上.解答应写出文字说明、证明过程或演算步骤."
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.097,
                0.442,
                0.626,
                0.48
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "11. 设 \\(D = \\left\\{(x, y) \\mid 0 \\leq x \\leq \\frac{\\pi}{2}, 0 \\leq y \\leq \\frac{\\pi}{2} \\right\\}\\), 求 \\(\\iint_{D} |cos(x + y)| dx dy\\).",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.099,
                0.487,
                0.664,
                0.525
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "12. 求 \\(\\iiint_{\\Omega} z \\, dv\\)，其中 \\(\\Omega\\) 是由 \\(z = x^2 + y^2\\) 及 \\(z = \\sqrt{2 - x^2 - y^2}\\) 围成的闭区域.",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.099,
                0.539,
                0.562,
                0.579
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "13. 设 \\(C\\) 为 \\(|x| + |y| = 1\\) 的正向，计算曲线积分 \\(\\oint_{C} \\frac{xdy - ydx}{|x| + |y|}\\).",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.098,
                0.595,
                0.607,
                0.611
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "14. 设曲面 \\(\\Sigma\\) 为 \\(z = 2 - x^{2} - y^{2}(1 \\leq z \\leq 2)\\) 的上侧，计算曲面积分.",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "equation",
            "bbox": [
                0.305,
                0.63,
                0.692,
                0.668
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "\\[\nI = \\iint_ {\\Sigma} (y - x) d y d z + (z - y) d z d x + (x - z) d x d y\n\\]"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.099,
                0.681,
                0.562,
                0.726
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "15. 求幂级数 \\(\\sum_{n=0}^{\\infty}(n+1)x^{2n}\\) 的和函数，并求级数 \\(\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}\\frac{n}{2^n}\\) 的值.",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.097,
                0.778,
                0.906,
                0.81
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "16. 求经过点 \\((2,1,\\frac{1}{3})\\) 的所有平面中，哪一个平面与三个坐标面所围成的四面体体积最小，并求其最小值.",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
